{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50761","headline":"晓别 · 张祜","name":"晓别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠羽朱冠碧树鸡，未鸣先下短墙啼。\n窗间谢女青蛾敛，门外萧郎白马嘶。\n斜汉繁星当烛尽，淡烟残月映花迷。\n景阳宫里晨锺动，不语垂鞭上柳堤。\n（《全唐诗》卷五七八作温庭筠诗，题作《赠知音》。\n别《才调集》卷二、《文苑英华》卷二八八亦作温诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}